	(text "U7: +3V3_C, logic of the carrier. U8: +3V3_A, ADC, comparators, DAC, monitor converter.\nThe regulators are specified for 10 uF at most on the output (datasheet). Over all sheets\n+3V3_A holds 3.8 uF and 4.7 uF more behind the 10 ohm of the reference supply, +3V3_C 2.4 uF\n(calculated). A disabled regulator empties its output through 230 ohm (datasheet), so\n+3V3_A starts from 0 V after every dip of the rail.\nR26 and D5: power indicator, 1.3 mA. R23 bleeds +5V when no source is connected.\nH1 to H4: mounting holes, tied to ground. FID1 to FID3: fiducials for the placement\nmachine."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4abeedcc-3648-56e0-ab8a-c8734a8ba8a0")
	)
	(text "U6 watches the 5 V rail. 5V_OK goes low when +5V falls below\n0.405 V x (1 + R21 / R22) = 3.91 V (3.83 V to 4.00 V with the tolerances) and returns\n0.18 s to 0.42 s after the rail has risen above 4.12 V at most (R24 selects 0.3 s typical).\n5V_OK is open drain with R25 to +5V. Low, it switches off U7 and U8 here and, on other\nsheets, the +12 V regulator, the charge pump and the pre-regulator: the carrier has one off\nstate, in which only +5V and +13V5 stay up. C12 filters SENSE with 9 us.\nTP9 held to ground keeps the carrier off during bring-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fd917723-e59b-52db-9b8f-e1bc9db5f679")
	)
